WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Thunder and Lightning!

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:05.180
The Thunder Warrior is not pleased with Mr.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.600
Chin's meal-chasing escapade!

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:31.560
And welcome to NEStalgia, a chronological exploration of every NES game released in North America.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.620
I'm Mike. And I'm Sean.

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:37.420
Did you know that this breakout game had a story?

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.480
